WEBVTT

00:01.810 --> 00:06.650
<b>On their carefree journey, 
 Satoshi and Pikachu reunited with Kasumi...</b>

00:06.650 --> 00:09.030
<b>...and ended up traveling with her.</b>

00:10.030 --> 00:12.530
<b>Ugh... I’m hungry...</b>

00:13.530 --> 00:17.000
<b>Oh yeah, we should find some place 
 to have a nice lunch or...</b>

00:17.000 --> 00:18.120
<b>Ooh!</b>

00:18.120 --> 00:18.750
<b>Huh?</b>

00:18.750 --> 00:20.170
<b>Perfect!</b>

00:20.540 --> 00:22.040
<b>Thank you for waiting.</b>

00:22.040 --> 00:24.670
<b>Here are your sandwiches 
 and special Pokémon food.</b>

00:26.460 --> 00:28.800
<b>Time to eat!</b>

00:29.930 --> 00:30.760
<b>Tasty!</b>

00:30.760 --> 00:31.550
<b>This is the best!</b>

00:32.300 --> 00:34.930
<b>But I feel like 
 I’ve tasted this flavor before...</b>

00:35.430 --> 00:37.310
<b>I thought the same thing.</b>

00:39.560 --> 00:41.900
<b>Oh! These are really tasty!</b>

00:42.650 --> 00:44.070
<b>Thank you.</b>

00:44.070 --> 00:46.690
<b>Manager! 
 They give their compliments!{[You]'ve received a "Delicious!"!}{Alt (since it's just Satoshi who said anything) - "Master! A customer gives his compliments!" - Toa}</b>

00:46.690 --> 00:50.030
<b>Really?{Too loose?} Thank you very much!</b>

00:50.030 --> 00:50.660
<b>Huh?</b>

00:50.660 --> 00:51.360
<b>Takeshi?!</b>

00:51.360 --> 00:53.030
<b>Satoshi! Kasumi!</b>

00:55.200 --> 00:56.910
<b>It’s been a while, Pikachu. {A whole X amount of time since the Arceus special}</b>

00:56.910 --> 00:58.910
<b>Hey, what are you doing here?</b>

00:59.500 --> 01:03.710
<b>Just what it looks like. 
 I got hired as this café’s manager.</b>

01:03.710 --> 01:05.170
<b>What about being 
 a Pokémon Doctor?!</b>

01:05.670 --> 01:06.920
<b>I decided... {I made up my mind.}</b>

01:06.920 --> 01:10.090
<b>...that I intend to devote my life 
 to helping that lady. {I intend to devote my life 
 to helping that lady.}</b>

01:10.090 --> 01:11.720
<b>Huh...?</b>

01:12.640 --> 01:14.550
<b>Takeshi, good news!</b>

01:14.550 --> 01:18.180
<b>My darling, who left to study cooking, 
 says he’s coming back to the café!</b>

01:19.810 --> 01:22.900
<b>And he says, 
 “When I get back, let’s get married.”</b>

01:22.900 --> 01:25.820
<b>Thank you for helping 
 support the café all this time!</b>

01:25.820 --> 01:26.730
<b>Y—</b>

01:26.730 --> 01:28.900
<b>You’re... welcome...</b>

