03:10.290 --> 03:12.420
<b>Cheer up, Takeshi!</b>

03:13.920 --> 03:16.930
<b>I was burned... 
 Burned up...</b>

03:17.340 --> 03:19.470
<b>Takeshi, 
 it’s like you used to say!{it’s like you said one time!/it’s like you said once!}{Takeshi, didn't you used to say}</b>

03:19.470 --> 03:21.680
<b>“Guys have to go for broke!”{Callback to DP180 where an idiom is crushed into dust: "Guys have to go for broke! And even if they're broken and broken and broken and broken and broken and broken and broken to bits, they've still got to go for broke! That's what real love is about! (Yeah!) Even if you're broken, go for it!"(男は当たって砕けろだ / しかも 当たって砕けて 砕けて 砕けて 砕けて 砕けて 砕けて 砕け散っても なお 当たって砕けろだ それが本当の恋というものなんだ！ / うん！ / 砕けても なお当たれ)}</b>

03:23.180 --> 03:24.480
<b>No...</b>

03:24.480 --> 03:27.190
<b>Not when you broke 
 without even going...</b>

03:27.190 --> 03:28.520
<b>He’s hopeless.</b>

03:28.520 --> 03:30.900
<b>What a mess...</b>

03:30.900 --> 03:32.690
<b>Huh? Satoshi?</b>

03:34.440 --> 03:35.820
<b>Dent!</b>

03:35.820 --> 03:37.820
<b>It really <i>was</i> you, Satoshi!</b>

03:37.820 --> 03:38.820
<b>It’s been so long!</b>

03:38.820 --> 03:39.700
<b>Oh!</b>

03:39.700 --> 03:42.160
<b>The guy who gave you that lure?{Part of me wants to fade this but since the line is not part of the flashback I think I shall refrain. -TLC}</b>

03:42.540 --> 03:44.910
<b>Yeah! I’ll introduce you.</b>

03:44.910 --> 03:46.160
<b>This is my travel buddy. {traveling companion}{reworded for CPS}</b>

03:46.620 --> 03:51.290
<b>Gym Leader of Hanada Gym, 
 world-class beauty, Kasumi!</b>

03:51.670 --> 03:53.210
<b>I’ve heard of you!</b>

03:53.210 --> 03:55.760
<b>The three beautiful sisters 
 of Hanada Gym are famous.</b>

03:55.760 --> 03:56.420
<b>Oh...</b>

03:56.420 --> 03:58.680
<b>Those are my sisters.</b>

03:58.680 --> 03:59.720
<b>Huh?</b>

03:59.720 --> 04:02.850
<b>Then, “the three beautiful sisters 
 and the spare” meant...{Phrase used several times in TOS, starting ep7}</b>

04:02.850 --> 04:05.600
<b>Spare?! 
 You looking for a fight?!{Alt: You trying to pick a fight?! - Trip & Toa}</b>

04:05.600 --> 04:08.230
<b>N-N-No, 
 I didn’t mean it like that...</b>

04:09.020 --> 04:11.150
<b>He’s another friend 
 who traveled with me.</b>

04:11.560 --> 04:14.780
<b>The Pokémon Sommelier, Dent.</b>

04:14.780 --> 04:17.280
<b>Huh? What’s a 
 Pokémon Sommelier?</b>

04:17.280 --> 04:19.780
<b>I’m ever so glad you asked!</b>

04:19.780 --> 04:22.580
<b>Would you send out 
 one of your Pokémon?</b>

04:24.290 --> 04:26.830
<b>Ach! Popping out 
 without permission <i>again...!</i></b>

04:26.830 --> 04:28.370
<b>A Koduck...?</b>

04:28.370 --> 04:29.370
<b>Interesting!</b>

04:29.370 --> 04:31.330
<b>It’s tasting time!</b>

04:31.330 --> 04:31.830
<b>Huh?</b>

04:32.210 --> 04:33.290
<b>Yes, yes...</b>

04:33.290 --> 04:39.180
<b>The glazed-over taste of Koduck and the spicy flavor 
 of the strong-willed Kasumi fit together perfectly!</b>

04:39.180 --> 04:43.970
<b>Even if you become agitated, it can soothe your heart 
 like a forest silent save for a gentle rain...</b>

04:43.970 --> 04:46.850
<b>The two of you truly are 
 a super <i>mariage!</i>{mariage: French for 'food and wine pairing'}</b>

04:46.850 --> 04:49.480
<b>Okay, okay... 
 I think I get it now.</b>

04:49.980 --> 04:54.110
<b>What a pity. My tasting was 
 just about to go into high gear...</b>

04:54.650 --> 04:56.980
<b>I’ve got one more person 
 to introduce you to.</b>

04:56.980 --> 04:59.740
<b>Another travel buddy, Takeshi.</b>

05:00.400 --> 05:00.990
<b>Hey...</b>

05:03.240 --> 05:04.240
<b>Takeshi?!</b>

05:04.700 --> 05:05.870
<b>You know him?</b>

05:05.870 --> 05:08.200
<b>We befriended one another 
 in the Johto Region.</b>

05:08.200 --> 05:11.830
<b>We even watched your recent 
 finals match together.</b>

05:11.830 --> 05:14.380
<b>Oh, of course! 
 Congratulations on your victory!</b>

05:14.380 --> 05:15.630
<b>Oh, thanks!</b>

05:15.630 --> 05:17.510
<b>So, what’s the matter with Takeshi?</b>

05:17.880 --> 05:21.630
<b>He’s exuding a hefty 
 negative aura{オーラ} indeed...</b>

05:21.630 --> 05:23.390
<b>Don’t ask.</b>

05:26.430 --> 05:28.680
<b>Ah... 
 Is it another heartbreak?</b>

05:28.680 --> 05:31.480
<b>Can’t we do something 
 to cheer him up?</b>

05:32.190 --> 05:34.270
<b>Hrm...</b>

05:34.270 --> 05:37.570
<b>I’ve got it! 
 There’s a flower field nearby!</b>

05:37.570 --> 05:40.280
<b>The fresh and cute flowers 
 are sure to perk him up!</b>

05:40.280 --> 05:41.530
<b>That’s it!</b>

05:43.950 --> 05:45.950
<b>Brat boy spotted, meow.</b>

05:45.950 --> 05:48.370
<b>Brat boy #2, 
 original brat girl,</b>

05:48.370 --> 05:50.370
<b>and even the sommelier boy 
 are with him, too...</b>

05:50.370 --> 05:53.420
<b>Anyway, this time 
 we’re catching that Pikachu for sure!</b>

05:56.210 --> 05:58.550
<b>Whoa! It’s so pretty!</b>

05:59.300 --> 06:00.260
<b>Come on, Takeshi...</b>

06:00.260 --> 06:02.050
<b>There’s lots of pretty flowers here!</b>

06:05.140 --> 06:09.680
<b>Beautiful... 
 Beauty reminds me of... Ladies!</b>

06:09.680 --> 06:10.890
<b>Ladies remind me of...</b>

06:14.900 --> 06:17.520
<b>Pull it together, Takeshi!</b>

06:27.620 --> 06:28.780
<b>Takeshi!</b>

06:28.780 --> 06:32.500
<b>Takeshi, 
 I <i>do</i> love you after all!</b>

06:32.500 --> 06:33.790
<b>Come over here!</b>

06:33.790 --> 06:36.290
<b>Yes, right away!</b>

06:36.710 --> 06:38.250
<b>Hey, Takeshi!</b>

06:38.250 --> 06:39.550
<b>Where are you going?</b>

06:39.880 --> 06:41.920
<b>Oh, Takeshi!</b>

06:45.550 --> 06:46.550
<b>What’s that?</b>

06:53.100 --> 06:53.600
<b>What is this?!</b>

06:53.600 --> 06:55.230
<b>Suddenly, my head hurts...</b>

06:57.650 --> 06:59.020
<b>What <i>is</i> that?!</b>

06:59.570 --> 07:03.900
<b>Brimuon. Silent Pokémon. 
 Psychic/Fairy type.</b>

07:03.900 --> 07:06.740
<b>It emits psychic power 
 strong enough to cause headaches...</b>

07:06.740 --> 07:09.160
<b>...as a deterrent 
 to the approach of others.{Sword dex entry}</b>

07:09.660 --> 07:11.660
<b>Ms. Kathy!</b>

07:12.160 --> 07:15.670
<b>Takeshi! This way, this way! 
 Come quick!</b>

07:18.040 --> 07:22.170
<b>Ms... Ka... thy!</b>

07:22.170 --> 07:23.960
<b>Return, Koduck!</b>

07:31.510 --> 07:33.180
<b>Takeshi!</b>

07:33.930 --> 07:34.980
<b>Takeshi!</b>

07:36.390 --> 07:38.150
<b>Where could he have gone?</b>

07:39.980 --> 07:43.860
<b>But... Why did Takeshi follow Brimuon 
 in the first place?</b>

07:43.860 --> 07:46.030
<b>Yeah... It’s a riddle.</b>

07:47.700 --> 07:49.200
<b>Did I hear you call for me?</b>

07:49.200 --> 07:49.700
<b>Huh?</b>

07:49.700 --> 07:51.990
<b>Sha-shing!</b>

07:53.370 --> 07:59.960
<b>If there’s a riddle to solve, as a Mystery Sommelier-
crossed-Sommelier Detective, you may leave it to me!</b>

07:59.960 --> 08:01.340
<b>Sommelier Detective?</b>

08:02.130 --> 08:05.590
<b>This world has no riddle that cannot be solved 
 and no cork that cannot be popped!</b>

08:05.590 --> 08:08.220
<b>It’s detective time!</b>

08:08.220 --> 08:10.720
<b>He seems like a pain.</b>

08:10.720 --> 08:15.350
<b>Brimuon can read the emotions 
 of creatures that are 50 kilometers away.{Kyodaimax Sword dex entry}</b>

08:15.350 --> 08:19.980
<b>Which means that, naturally, she’s reading 
 the emotions of the presently heartbroken Takeshi.</b>

08:19.980 --> 08:20.980
<b>Right, right...</b>

08:21.360 --> 08:24.190
<b>The reason Takeshi 
 pursued Brimuon...</b>

08:24.190 --> 08:29.240
<b>...is probably that Brimuon lured him in 
 with her strong psychic powers.</b>

08:29.240 --> 08:31.120
<b>But why?</b>

08:31.120 --> 08:36.160
<b>Our hints are Takeshi’s negative aura{オーラ} 
 and Brimuon’s alias.</b>

08:36.160 --> 08:37.910
<b>Said alias being...</b>

08:38.540 --> 08:39.620
<b>The Forest Witch!</b>

08:40.210 --> 08:41.630
<b>The Forest Witch?!</b>

08:41.630 --> 08:44.500
<b>The Forest Witch is said to love 
 negative auras{オーラ}...</b>

08:44.500 --> 08:49.010
<b>...and trap those who have them 
 inside the forest!</b>

08:49.010 --> 08:50.260
<b>Wha—?!</b>

08:50.260 --> 08:52.430
<b>Also, the Index 
 contains this passage:</b>

08:52.430 --> 08:56.140
<b>“If you’re too loud around it, 
 you risk being torn apart by the claws on its tentacle”!{Shield dex entry}</b>

08:56.140 --> 08:57.680
<b><i>What?!</i></b>

08:57.680 --> 09:00.390
<b>That’s a pretty crazy Pokémon!</b>

09:01.020 --> 09:02.900
<b>As things stand, Takeshi may...</b>

09:02.900 --> 09:04.820
<b>We gotta save him quick!</b>

