<b>m 0 0 m 1290 960 l 1530 960 l 1530 1024.5 l 1290 1024.5</b>

09:17.450 --> 09:19.460
<b>Takeshi!</b>

09:19.460 --> 09:20.460
<b>Where are you?</b>

09:20.460 --> 09:21.460
<b>Takeshi!</b>

09:26.590 --> 09:27.920
<b>What is it, Pikachu?</b>

09:29.090 --> 09:30.300
<b>What’s that?</b>

09:30.300 --> 09:33.300
<b>Mibrim. Calm Pokémon. 
 Psychic type.</b>

09:34.260 --> 09:37.260
<b>Via the protrusion on its head, 
 it senses other creatures’ emotions.</b>

09:37.260 --> 09:39.930
<b>If you don’t have a calm disposition, 
 it will never warm up to you.{Sword dex entry}</b>

09:39.930 --> 09:43.900
<b>How cute! 
 She looks like a kind Pokémon!</b>

09:43.900 --> 09:47.650
<b>“Via the protrusion on its head, 
 it senses other creatures’ emotions,” huh...?</b>

09:47.650 --> 09:48.360
<b>Oh!</b>

09:48.900 --> 09:51.150
<b>Mibrim might be able 
 to find Takeshi.</b>

09:51.150 --> 09:51.700
<b>Huh?</b>

09:52.030 --> 09:54.780
<b>If she can sense the 
 negative aura{オーラ} Takeshi is exuding,{Might be too literal but idk, i just kind of like having him repeat the idea that Takeshi is just OOZING sadness right now. -TLC}{Oh, "Takeshi is exuding" comes up later in the script as a TL for this exact same phrase I HAVE BEEN VINDICATED. -TLC}</b>

09:54.780 --> 09:56.870
<b>she’ll know where he is!</b>

09:56.870 --> 09:58.490
<b>That’s a good idea!</b>

09:58.490 --> 09:59.950
<b>Hey, Mibrim...</b>

09:59.950 --> 10:02.460
<b>Can you help 
 look for my friend?{He does in fact only specify that Takeshi is HIS friend here. To hell with Kasumi and Dent, I guess... -TLC}</b>

10:03.960 --> 10:07.840
<b>Someone who’s important to us 
 could be in danger.</b>

10:07.840 --> 10:08.460
<b>Please!</b>

10:14.300 --> 10:16.050
<b>Was that an okay?</b>

10:16.600 --> 10:18.060
<b>Thanks, Mibrim!</b>

10:18.060 --> 10:20.560
<b>Then, Satoshi... 
 Think about Takeshi.</b>

10:21.020 --> 10:22.140
<b>Got it.</b>

10:26.560 --> 10:29.320
<b>Mibrim! 
 Can you sense anything?</b>

10:36.620 --> 10:37.450
<b>I love you!</b>

10:37.450 --> 10:39.200
<b>L-Likewise!</b>

10:39.200 --> 10:41.080
<b>Hmph! I hate you after all.</b>

10:41.080 --> 10:43.580
<b>N-No way...</b>

10:43.580 --> 10:44.500
<b>I love you!</b>

10:44.500 --> 10:45.750
<b>L-Likewise!</b>

10:45.750 --> 10:47.080
<b>I hate you after all.</b>

10:47.080 --> 10:48.090
<b>N-No way...</b>

10:48.090 --> 10:48.880
<b>I love you!</b>

10:48.880 --> 10:49.880
<b>Likewise!</b>

10:49.880 --> 10:50.590
<b>I hate you!</b>

10:50.590 --> 10:52.460
<b>No way...</b>

10:52.460 --> 10:53.340
<b>Love!</b>

10:53.340 --> 10:54.010
<b>Hate!</b>

10:54.010 --> 10:54.800
<b>Hate...</b>

11:02.930 --> 11:04.270
<b>Looks like she sensed him!</b>

11:04.270 --> 11:05.020
<b>Right!</b>

11:10.690 --> 11:11.820
<b>Another Pokémon.</b>

11:14.320 --> 11:17.070
<b>Ooh! She looks like a stuffed toy!</b>

11:17.070 --> 11:19.580
<b>She has quite a cute taste to her.</b>

11:20.160 --> 11:23.290
<b>Tebrim. Serene Pokémon. 
 Psychic type.</b>

11:23.290 --> 11:25.080
<b>The evolved form of Mibrim.</b>

11:26.250 --> 11:28.420
<b>So that’s why she looks like you.</b>

11:29.920 --> 11:34.760
<b>It uses the braids on its head to pummel into silence 
 anyone with strong emotions, no matter who they are.{partial Sword dex entry and partial Shield dex entry, retranslated to fit}</b>

11:34.760 --> 11:37.340
<b>They are strong enough to 
 one-punch{more common than one-hit when referring to boxing} KO a pro boxer.{rest of Shield dex entry, also reworded}</b>

11:37.340 --> 11:38.470
<b><i>Huh?!</i></b>

11:38.470 --> 11:41.010
<b>Did someone have 
 strong emotions?</b>

11:41.010 --> 11:44.350
<b>I’ve been thinking super hard 
 that I wanna save Takeshi.</b>

11:44.350 --> 11:45.480
<b>Which means...</b>

12:07.120 --> 12:08.710
<b>That was a shock.</b>

12:08.710 --> 12:11.170
<b>What a difference from Mibrim.</b>

12:12.090 --> 12:15.170
<b>Mibrim, can you still sense 
 Takeshi’s aura{オーラ}?</b>

12:20.800 --> 12:21.970
<b>You got it?</b>

12:23.310 --> 12:24.390
<b>Okay, let’s hurry!</b>

12:24.390 --> 12:25.100
<b>Yeah!</b>

12:32.520 --> 12:35.190
<b>Sheesh... 
 You just ate earlier.</b>

12:35.190 --> 12:37.110
<b>All this running 
 made me hungry again.</b>

12:40.110 --> 12:42.370
<b>Uhh... Likewise.</b>

12:42.370 --> 12:46.000
<b>As a Metro Sommelier-crossed- 
 Train Station Boxed Lunch Sommelier,</b>

12:46.000 --> 12:49.250
<b>I’d love to eat one of the train station 
 boxed lunches exclusive to this region...</b>

12:49.250 --> 12:52.000
<b>I wanna eat 
 my mom’s croquettes...</b>

12:52.000 --> 12:55.460
<b>Hey, how can you two 
 act so nonchalant...?</b>

12:58.380 --> 13:00.930
<b>Bugs bug me!</b>

13:01.510 --> 13:05.760
<b>Kasumi loves Water types, 
 but can’t handle Bug types.</b>

13:05.760 --> 13:10.940
<b>Huh... Then what about Shizukumo, 
 which has both the Water type and Bug type?</b>

13:10.940 --> 13:15.360
<b>Hmm... That’s a tough one.</b>

13:21.410 --> 13:22.610
<b>Satoshi!</b>

13:23.570 --> 13:24.780
<b>Huh?</b>

13:25.830 --> 13:27.450
<b>Mom!</b>

13:28.540 --> 13:29.200
<b>Satoshi?</b>

13:30.160 --> 13:32.670
<b>Here’s some freshly baked croquettes. 
 Eat up.</b>

13:32.670 --> 13:34.130
<b>All right!</b>

13:34.130 --> 13:35.710
<b>Time to dig in!</b>

13:35.710 --> 13:36.590
<b>Huh?</b>

13:36.590 --> 13:39.470
<b>Wait up! Mom!</b>

13:39.470 --> 13:41.800
<b>Hey, Satoshi, 
 where are you going?</b>

13:50.560 --> 13:52.140
<b>Wait for me!</b>

13:52.140 --> 13:54.810
<b>What happened to Satoshi 
 and Kasumi all of a sudden?</b>

13:57.780 --> 14:00.900
<b>Train station boxed lunches, 
 safety check complete!</b>

